%% Sequence diagram UC2: datasource document synchronization to a profile.
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px"},"sequence":{"actorMargin":24,"messageMargin":18,"boxMargin":6,"boxTextMargin":4,"noteMargin":6,"useMaxWidth":true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as User
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as HTTP API
    participant Profile as Profile Service
    participant Source as Datasource Repository
    participant Monitor as Run Repository
    participant Broker as RabbitMQ
    Admin->>UI: Open processing tab
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/profiles/{id}/documents
    API->>Monitor: Read latest run summaries
    Monitor-->>API: Status, attempt, updated_at
    API-->>UI: Processing list
    Admin->>UI: Start synchronization
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/profiles/{id}/sync
    API->>Profile: Resolve profile and datasource
    Profile->>Source: List active documents
    loop Each active document
        Profile->>Monitor: Find or create profile-document run
        alt Projection already exists
            Monitor-->>Profile: already_present
        else New projection required
            Profile->>Broker: Publish rag.parse.requested
            Monitor-->>Profile: dispatched
        end
    end
    Profile-->>API: Counts and per-document results
    API-->>UI: Updated processing summary
